    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Esmé Cowles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I believe this is still working correctly, and that this IT would fail if it wasn't: ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-api/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/integration/http/api/FedoraLdpIT.java#L1561"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-api/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/integration/http/api/FedoraLdpIT.java#L1561",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " — and I just tested a fresh build of master and found that I could populate the filename using Content-Disposition, e.g.:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "attrs": {
         "language": "java"
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "$ curl -X PUT -H \"Content-Disposition: inline; filename=\\\"foo.txt\\\"\" -d \"foo\" -H \"Content-type: text/plain\" -H \"Link: <http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource>; rel=\\\"type\\\"\" http://localhost:8080/rest/file2",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "codeBlock"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Are you seeing something different? Is the issue that if no Content-Disposition header is supplied, that there is a blank filename?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
