     "body": "<p>Ah, I didn't know it still worked.  Creating NonRDFSources \"by the book\" (strictly following the specs) results in a filename of \"\".  If that is OK, then I suppose that means this is one of those \"clean up\" issues to consider if/when we decide to remove non-specified behaviour from the API.  </p>",
